  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus &#xe0; la fin du projet (juin 2021) : 1) le recrutement et l&#x2019;int&#xe9;gration du personnel au sein de l&#x2019;&#xe9;quipe d&#x2019;enqu&#xea;te et d&#x2019;identification de l&#x2019;OIAC; 2) la publication d&#x2019;un rapport d&#x2019;analyse sur 3 incidents pr&#xe9;sum&#xe9;s d&#x2019;armes chimiques en Syrie entre le 24 et le 30 mars 2017; 3) la conception et le d&#xe9;ploiement d&#x2019;une nouvelle infrastructure r&#xe9;seau afin de r&#xe9;duire les vuln&#xe9;rabilit&#xe9;s en mati&#xe8;re de cybers&#xe9;curit&#xe9;.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved at the end of the project (June 2021) include: (1) recruited and integrated personnel into the OPCW Investigation and Identification Team; (2) published an analytical report on 3 alleged chemical weapons incidents in Syria between March 24 and 30, 2017; and (3) designed and deployed a new network infrastructure to reduce cybersecurity vulnerabilities.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration de la capacit&#xe9; de l&#x2019;OIAC &#xe0; enqu&#xea;ter sur les incidents li&#xe9;s aux armes chimiques en Syrie; 2) le renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s de l&#x2019;OIAC pour que celle-ci soit mieux &#xe0; m&#xea;me d&#x2019;exercer son r&#xf4;le d&#x2019;organe d&#x2019;application de la Convention sur les armes chimiques.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) increased capacity of the OPCW to investigate incidents involving chemical weapons in Syria; and (2) strengthened OPCW capabilities to better fulfill its role as the implementing body of the Chemical Weapons Convention.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
